{"id":"work-6497","sourceIds":{"anilist":6162,"mal":6162},"info":{"title":"Tailenders","originalTitle":"Tailenders","synopsis":"Su Tellus, un pianeta parzialmente esplorato abitato da pionieri immigrati e sconvolto da terremoti causati da macchine di terraformazione chiamati \"Stampedes\", il giovane pilota Shiro resta gravemente ferito durante un inseguimento al leggendario \"Loser King\", insieme al suo rivale di sempre, Goodspeed. In fin di vita, riceve la visita di una misteriosa donna, Tomoe, che gli offre una seconda possibilità: partecipare alla Planet Re-Development Race, una gara annuale per temerari provenienti da tutto il mondo. In palio non ci sono solo ricchezze, ma anche la possibilità di esplorare le zone ancora ignote del pianeta.","type":"movie","status":"completed","statusLabel":"Finito","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"16 Ottobre 2009","year":2009,"season":"Autunno 2009","studios":["Picograph"],"genres":["Avventura","Azione","Sci-Fi"],"durationLabel":"27 min","declaredEpisodeCount":1,"availableEpisodeCount":1,"rating":6.17,"ratingCount":6,"views":338,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/41FU32RPNo3B9PUkuGkIbe0U6op.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"animeworld:img","path":"/copertine/IkIH5.png"},"sourceType":"Movie","tags":["Movie","Finito","2009"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[6162],"malIds":[6162],"anidbIds":[6766],"imdbMovieIds":["tt16769860"],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[60705],"tmdbShowIds":[],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:6162","mal:6162"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6766","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6162","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt16769860","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"6162","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"60705","ranges":{"1":"1"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6766","scope":"R","raw":"anidb:6766:R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6162","raw":"anilist:6162","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt16769860","raw":"imdb_movie:tt16769860","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"6162","raw":"mal:6162","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"60705","raw":"tmdb_movie:60705","ranges":{"1":"1"}}],"imdbId":"tt16769860","sourceIds":{"anilist":6162,"mal":6162},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":60705,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/60705","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T18:16:22.815Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Tailenders","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"TAILENDERS","overview":{"value":"Premiered in Sapporo Short Fest 2009. The destiny of Tomoe Shiro, a formidable racer with a very promising career, experiments an U-turn when a serious accident puts his life at stake. He recovers miraculously, though, when his heart is replaced with the engine of his own racing car. However, because of that very reason, race regulations demote him to the category of a mere mechanical part of the vehicle and is deprived from the right to participate as a pilot in regular races. Only in a far away colonial planet, along with a multitude of other charismatic pilots also vetoed from participating in regular competitions, he will be given the opportunity to race for his pride and the money of the prize. And so this exciting rally starts!!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2009-10-16","status":"Released","rating":6.3,"ratingCount":6,"genres":["Fantascienza","Animazione","Azione"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"27m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":221772,"name":"Wataru Hatano","role":"Shiro Tomoe (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg"},{"id":225603,"name":"Kenta Miyake","role":"Good Speed (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7YL8vM2KYzPMeQqTpHWmNj6s1AP.jpg"},{"id":1222101,"name":"Ryusuke Ohbayashi","role":"Loser King (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vX9XqfSkE4N5VTdbW3iCrqk4chs.jpg"},{"id":114906,"name":"Ryoka Yuzuki","role":"Tomoe Mikagura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRiagleTO13MWYXl77xGDBDerxM.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Tailenders","overview":"Premiered in Sapporo Short Fest 2009. The destiny of Tomoe Shiro, a formidable racer with a very promising career, experiments an U-turn when a serious accident puts his life at stake. He recovers miraculously, though, when his heart is replaced with the engine of his own racing car. However, because of that very reason, race regulations demote him to the category of a mere mechanical part of the vehicle and is deprived from the right to participate as a pilot in regular races. Only in a far away colonial planet, along with a multitude of other charismatic pilots also vetoed from participating in regular competitions, he will be given the opportunity to race for his pride and the money of the prize. And so this exciting rally starts!!"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"TAILENDERS","overview":"時は遥か未来、人類が宇宙の新天地に手を伸ばした頃の話。新天地「惑星テルルス」に安住の場所は失われた。  数百年前に起きたテラフォーミングマシンの暴走により、急速に環境変動が進むテルルス。人類はその星で、テラフォーミングマシンのスタンピード現象に追い立てられるまま、巨大な車輪の上にその営みを移していた。  しかし、その時代に逆行する者達がいた…。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/41FU32RPNo3B9PUkuGkIbe0U6op.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/41FU32RPNo3B9PUkuGkIbe0U6op.jpg","language":"xx","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aXjMefSpms4C3tvmKqIv1K1C2PE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aXjMefSpms4C3tvmKqIv1K1C2PE.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/daJYTjJSxdIBIUQm1M3VFxDI3Hl.jpg","p